#: ../../source/docs/unit-tests.rst:5 c18642fa44da4ea8870d1779e65da0e6
msgid "ArduPilot Unit Tests"
msgstr "ArduPilot 单元测试"

#: ../../source/docs/unit-tests.rst:7 605159e0f2564643bfbf7e33febdf24d
msgid ""
"ArduPilot's Unit Test suite allows for the creation of repeatable tests "
"which help prevent regressions in ArduPilot's internal functions.  It is "
"based on Google's `GTest Framework "
"<https://github.com/google/googletest>`__."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 的单元测试套件支持创建可重复执行的测试，有助于防止 ArduPilot 内部函数出现回归问题。它基于 Google 的 "
"`GTest 框架 <https://github.com/google/googletest>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/unit-tests.rst:11 08672ba0e2854b30afe5dfac1bc6a3ae
msgid "Using ArduPilot's Unit Tests can:"
msgstr "使用 ArduPilot 单元测试可以："

#: ../../source/docs/unit-tests.rst:13 e2b562c3a3ee4785921e228a887a6a2c
msgid ""
"make your development process more efficient by reducing time spent "
"repeatedly running the same tests to force the same inputs to a function "
"time and again"
msgstr "通过减少反复向函数输入相同数据以重复运行相同测试所花费的时间，提高开发效率"

#: ../../source/docs/unit-tests.rst:14 c83ed0412bf34631b7a85e70ac6e5db0
msgid ""
"allow you to repeatedly replicate bad behaviour in an ArduPilot function,"
" and possibly ship that test to a developer capable of fixing the issue "
"(\"test-driven-development\")"
msgstr "允许反复复现 ArduPilot 函数中的异常行为，并可将测试用例提交给能够修复该问题的开发者（「测试驱动开发」）"

#: ../../source/docs/unit-tests.rst:15 6b2e3d634ff44c508ef401780caee46d
msgid ""
"reduce the chances of a regression in an ArduPilot function's behaviour "
"by locking in tests for that function's behaviour"
msgstr "通过固定对特定函数行为的测试，降低该函数出现行为回归的可能性"

#: ../../source/docs/unit-tests.rst:18 f72523efd8bf4524b78b8eddeb73194f
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/unit-tests.rst:20 d92a43cddc9b4429b99d6d70f4917bc3
msgid ""
"The Unit test suite is run on ArduPilot's autotest server on most commits"
" to the master branch, but can be run locally to vet software changes.  "
"Adding tests is straight-forward and encouraged to prove a function's "
"correctness after a change."
msgstr ""
"单元测试套件会在大多数 commit 提交到 master 分支时在 ArduPilot "
"自动化测试服务器上运行，也可以在本地运行以验证软件更改。添加测试非常简单，建议在修改后通过测试证明函数的正确性。"

#: ../../source/docs/unit-tests.rst:27 530ccd709dba4b62a067e5ecfe053d0e
msgid "Running Unit Tests"
msgstr "运行单元测试"

#: ../../source/docs/unit-tests.rst:29 0bc355b073344002ab386b65fe03655b
msgid ""
"The Unit Tests require an environment in which the ArduPilot executables "
"can be compiled.  The easiest way to obtain this is to create a SITL "
"testing environment.  Use the SITL instructions (:ref:`SITL <using-sitl-"
"for-ardupilot-testing>`) to obtain a valid environment.  It is suggested "
"the ArduPilot Vagrant virtual machine configuration files be used to "
"obtain a working environment."
msgstr ""
"单元测试需要一个能够编译 ArduPilot 可执行文件的环境。最简便的方法是创建一个 SITL 测试环境。请参照 SITL "
"说明（:ref:`SITL <using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing>`）搭建有效的环境。建议使用 ArduPilot "
"Vagrant 虚拟机配置文件来获取可用的工作环境。"

#: ../../source/docs/unit-tests.rst:32 6ce19f5e1d6d4c2cb903e749a23d4cea
msgid "Invocation"
msgstr "调用方式"

#: ../../source/docs/unit-tests.rst:36 74c8ba2a9f614933bac5677c03340af2
msgid ""
"These tests work well under Linux.  Operation under different "
"environments is unknown."
msgstr "这些测试在 Linux 下运行良好。在其他环境下的运行情况未知。"

#: ../../source/docs/unit-tests.rst:38 9a6b2fc2791f4865969cfaf7c5e5acee
msgid "The unit tests are compiled using the `waf` build tool:"
msgstr "单元测试使用 `waf` 构建工具进行编译："

#: ../../source/docs/unit-tests.rst:68 162f9e7a7cd14743bd572169992495d6
msgid "You can then simply run the test from the build directory:"
msgstr "然后可以直接从构建目录运行测试："

#: ../../source/docs/unit-tests.rst:98 188d97743d03470393a7ec14a07ca0e1
msgid "Using with GDB"
msgstr "与 GDB 结合使用"

#: ../../source/docs/unit-tests.rst:100 424c6d9f955d4883a105c9e4fba27a3c
msgid "The tests can be run under GDB to trace problems:"
msgstr "可以在 GDB 下运行测试以追踪问题："

#: ../../source/docs/unit-tests.rst:131 0c133ab1896948169070661b14fd9c08
msgid "Using with Valgrind"
msgstr "与 Valgrind 结合使用"

#: ../../source/docs/unit-tests.rst:133 291a0364d8e447bdbd39cfd4346aa39b
msgid ""
"The tests can be run under Valgrind's memcheck too to trace memory "
"problems:"
msgstr "也可以在 Valgrind 的 memcheck 工具下运行测试以追踪内存问题："

#: ../../source/docs/unit-tests.rst:179 884aa12e6be0429e85815ba435ada8b6
msgid "Unit Tests Structure"
msgstr "单元测试结构"

#: ../../source/docs/unit-tests.rst:181 ef3476448d794e36aeadc22466014594
msgid ""
"A directory in the ArduPilot source tree can contain a `wscript` file "
"designating it as containing unit tests."
msgstr "ArduPilot 源代码树中的某个目录可以包含一个 `wscript` 文件，用于标识该目录包含单元测试。"

#: ../../source/docs/unit-tests.rst:183 74840e7b408941c89d77c865f8296a55
msgid ""
"Each .cpp file in that directory is then considered a valid test, and "
"will be included in the tests compiled when `waf` is invoked for the "
"`tests` target."
msgstr "该目录中的每个 .cpp 文件都被视为有效测试，在以 `tests` 为目标调用 `waf` 时将被编译为测试。"

#: ../../source/docs/unit-tests.rst:185 c359b1c55b024738a824215be862fa5c
